<title>USA: BJ Services sees future more promising.</title>
<headline>BJ Services sees future more promising.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BJ Services Co said the future prospects for the company &quot;look more promising than at any time in recent history.&quot;</p>
<p>BJ Services said despite recent volatility in oil and natural gas prices, customers appear to remain committed to their announced drilling plans.</p>
<p>BJ Services said it is optimistic that it is in the early stages of a longer-term industry recovery.</p>
<p>BJ services provides pressure pumping and related services to the petroleum industry.</p>
</text>
